WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
It is time to recognize that while you thought the enemy was the immigrant, or you thought

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.640
the enemy was the trans person, or you thought the enemy was the black folk, it is not any

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.880
of those people on the list.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:22.680
It is the old, white, nepo baby that is sitting in the White House.

